  "description": "OEDRO floor liners provide total protection to the front and rear of your Jeep Wagoneer footwell. Offers 300% better temperature resistance than PVC materials; The mats are non-toxic, odorless, and contain no latex, cadmium, lead, or harmful PVC.\nFeatures\nDurability. One of the best things about OEDRO floor mats is that they are developed with solid rubber. This gives them longevity in comparison to other styles of mats. The floor mats are quite flexible. The heavy-duty material is also capable of withstanding constant rubbing and contacting of shoes.\nExcellent Visual Appearance. Adding an all-weather floor liner to your car's interior will add color and class to your car. The mat’s unique appearance will accentuate the interior look of your car tenfold.\nProtecting the Interior. OEDRO Floor mats offer vehicles perhaps the most comprehensive interior protection in comparison to any other car mat. Your car’s carpet will remain clean and dry at all times.\nCleaning these Mats is Quite Easy. The materials used for creating floor mats are extremely simple to wash and clean. You can easily pass and clean the spillage on top of it. You can also spray it using soap and water. Also, there won’t be any odor remaining once the mat dries out.\nIt Traps Dirt and Moisture. The waterproof surface of all-weather floor mats makes sure to trap any kind of spillage on top of it. The mats can also trap dust, sand, and other dry particles effectively.\n2-Years Warranty | Professional installation is highly recommended for safety.\nFitment\nCompatible with 2022 2023 2024 2025 Jeep Wagoneer 8 Passenger Models .\nPlease Make sure the 2nd Row Seat type is Bench Seater\nNot for Vinyl Floor",
